# Forms

Use Server Actions + `useActionState`:

```tsx
const [state, formAction, pending] = useActionState(myAction, initialState);
```

- Form: `className="flex flex-col gap-6"`
- Field groups: `gap-2`
- Required: red asterisk on Label
- Errors: `text-sm text-red-600` from `state.fieldErrors`
- Submit button shows pending state
- Do not use react-hook-form unless explicitly approved
